    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": "p",
     "text": "Local answers",
     "classes": []
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": "h2",
     "text": "Where Can I Get a Construction Logo Designed in Austin?",
     "align": "left",
     "classes": []
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p>Logo Design Austin designs logos for contractors throughout Austin and the surrounding counties, and every project runs remotely. You can talk with a designer between job sites by phone or text and approve proofs from your truck.</p><h3>Home builder and remodeler logos for Westlake (78746), Tarrytown (78703) and Lakeway (78734)</h3><p>Custom builders and remodelers working higher-end projects benefit from a refined mark that looks as good on a site sign in front of a hillside build as it does on a proposal binder.</p><h3>Roofing, concrete and trade logos in East Austin (78702), Del Valle (78617) and Manor (78653)</h3><p>Trades growing on the east side and out toward the airport need logos that stand out on work trucks and trailers. We favor bold shapes and high-contrast colors that stay readable on a dusty tailgate.</p><h3>Commercial contractor logos in Round Rock (78664), Georgetown (78626) and Hutto (78634)</h3><p>Williamson County is full of new commercial and residential development. A professional identity helps on prequalification packets, site fencing banners and your website.</p><h3>How much does a construction logo cost in Austin?</h3><p>A custom construction logo at Logo Design Austin is priced from $125 to $175, depending on complexity. There is no upfront payment; you review concepts, request revisions and pay once you approve the final design.</p>",
     "align": "left",
     "classes": []
    },
    {
     "t": "container",
     "classes": [],
     "dir": "row",
     "wrap": true,
     "width": 100,
