   "variant": "faq",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "container",
     "classes": [
      "lda-head",
      "lda-center"
     ],
     "dir": "column",
     "wrap": false,
     "boxed": false,
     "align": "center",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "p",
       "text": "Questions, answered",
       "classes": []
      },
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h2",
       "text": "Construction Logo Design FAQs",
       "align": "center",
       "classes": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "What colors work best for a construction logo?",
       "a": "<p>High-contrast combinations such as orange and charcoal, navy and yellow, or red and black stand out on trucks and signs. We keep the palette to one or two colors so the logo is affordable to print and easy to cut from vinyl.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Should my contractor logo show a hammer, house or excavator?",
       "a": "<p>A tool or equipment icon can help people understand your trade at a glance, but common icons can look generic. We often show one literal concept and one more distinctive concept, such as a monogram or a custom shape, so you can compare.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Will my logo work on a truck door and a hard hat?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We design a full version for truck doors and signs, plus a compact icon or monogram for hard hats, caps and social profiles.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How much does a construction logo cost in Austin?",
       "a": "<p>Custom logo design at Logo Design Austin is priced from $125 to $175, depending on complexity, with no upfront payment. You pay after you approve the final design.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "What file does my sign or wrap shop need?",
       "a": "<p>Most sign and wrap shops ask for a vector file such as AI, EPS, SVG or a vector PDF. You receive all of those, plus high-resolution PNGs for your website and social media.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can you redesign my existing construction logo?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We can modernize an older logo, fix a blurry file or rebuild a logo you made with AI so it works on trucks, signs and uniforms.</p>"
      }
     ],
     "classes": []
    }
   ]
  },
